# DPT-Henry/Regular -- cmap for Regular.png (see docs/framebuf/bmfont.md)
U+0020..U+007E  0     # printable ASCII
U+00A0          0     # NBSP shares space
U+00A9          95    # copyright sign, drawn in the DEL cell
# Lookalikes below reuse the ASCII cells: spaces, dashes, quotes, Greek,
# Cyrillic, Roman numerals, maths operators and fullwidth forms.
